    "description": "Assignment 1 15.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SEM101 · Assessment 1/6</span>\n<h2>Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14230 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SEM101 · Đầu điểm 1/6</span>\n<h2>Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14230 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">15mins/ group</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LOs 1-2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Written &amp; presentation</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Lessons and topics learned from Units 1~15 of the Coursebook. Topics are to be chosen by the teacher.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">In class, supervised by the class' instructor.Students will be divided into groups of 4 members. In cases where the total number of students does not allow for equal grouping, teams of three or five members may be formed to accommodate the class size. Each group will present a topic/ unit from the lesson using powerpoints and other visual aids.Topics will be asigned by the instructor.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 25 — Assignment 1 Presentation &amp; Feedback</li><li>Session 26 — Assignment 1 Presentation &amp; Feedback</li><li>Session 58 — Assignment 2 Presentation and Feedback</li><li>Session 59 — Assignment 2 Presentation and Feedback</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 25 — Assignment 1 Presentation &amp; Feedback</li><li>Buổi 26 — Assignment 1 Presentation &amp; Feedback</li><li>Buổi 58 — Assignment 2 Presentation and Feedback</li><li>Buổi 59 — Assignment 2 Presentation and Feedback</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
